{
  "name": "YouTube search results to Google Sheets every morning",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## YouTube search results to Google Sheets every morning\n\nEvery morning, search YouTube for your keywords and get each video with title, channel, views and date, and append the rows to a Google Sheet.\n\n### Setup (3 minutes)\n1. **Apify token** - create a free account at apify.com and copy your API token (Settings > API & Integrations).\n   In the **Search YouTube** node, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n2. **Google Sheets** node - connect your Google account and paste the URL of an empty sheet. Columns are created from the data automatically.\n3. Edit the JSON body of **Search YouTube** with your own inputs, then activate the workflow.\n\n**Cost:** $0.50 per 1,000 videos, no API key. `maxTotalChargeUsd` in the body is a hard cap per run.\nActor: https://apify.com/om_kh/vigia-youtube-search-monitor",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -540,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "b36b61ce-09af-405b-badd-19407fe55095"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "3255dfe3-ae81-4df8-9fe9-3e3d47722dd8"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/om_kh~vigia-youtube-search-monitor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"searchTerms\": [\n    \"python tutorial\"\n  ],\n  \"maxResults\": 60,\n  \"maxTotalChargeUsd\": 0.5\n}",
